6.7 多租户配置管理:
- tenant_llm_config_manager.py: 3-layer config resolution (global ← tenant ← subject overlay)
- factory.py: get_provider(school_id=1) with per-school caching
- app.py: GET/PUT/DELETE /api/admin/tenant-config endpoints
- NULL inheritance: unset fields inherit from global defaults

6.10 AI内容安全过滤:
- content_safety_filter.py: 5-dimension audit → 3-level decision (pass/degrade/block)
- prompts/content_safety_filter.md: filter system prompt
- Integration hooks in grader.py (overall_feedback), correction_grader.py (encouragement), emotional_feedback.py (output text)
- Degradation fallbacks per scenario
- Filter log persistence + audit trail
- app.py: GET /api/admin/filter-logs, /api/admin/filter-stats

6.9 新学校接入流程:
- scripts/onboard_school.py: one-click school + grades + classes + admin + tenant config
- --dry-run mode

6.12 定时备份+恢复演练:
- scripts/backup_drill.py: monthly recovery drill with report
- deploy/crontab/seewo-crontab: crontab template

Tests: 32 new tests (test_sprint6.py), 83 existing tests verified passing
